   "muc": "II. Kiến thức",
   "neo": "Vì sao không có dụng cụ đo thẳng nhiệt lượng? Cách làm thay ",
   "hoi": "Vì sao không có dụng cụ đo thẳng nhiệt lượng? Cách làm thay thế?",
   "dap": "<ul><li><strong>Từ khoá:</strong> không có dụng cụ đo $Q$</li><li>Đo $P$, $\\tau$ → $Q = P\\tau$</li><li>Đo $m$, $\\Delta t$</li></ul>",
   "tieu_muc": "1. Ba phép đo và dụng cụ",
   "hinh": "<figure class=\"fig\" data-tl=\"1\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 440 381\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Đường cong đun nóng 0,5 kg nước đá bằng bếp 500 W, trục thời gian theo tỉ lệ thật: nhiệt độ tăng từ −10 lên 0 độ C trong 21 giây, đứng ở 0 độ C 334 giây khi tan, tăng tới 100 độ C trong 420 giây, rồi đứng ở 100 độ C 2260 giây khi sôi\"><defs><marker id=\"f2-r\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#f87171\"/></marker><marker id=\"f2-b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"/></marker><marker id=\"f2-o\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#fb923c\"/></marker><marker id=\"f2-g\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#34d399\"/></marker></defs><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">Đun 0,500 kg nước đá bằng bếp 500 W</text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"279.0\" x2=\"424\" y2=\"279.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"1\"/><path d=\"M419.3,274.0 L428.0,279.0 L419.3,284.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"279.0\" x2=\"64\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"1\"/><path d=\"M59.0,48.7 L64.0,40.0 L69.0,48.7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"miter\" stroke-miterlimit=\"10\" stroke-linecap=\"butt\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"48\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">t (°C)</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"97.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">100</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"267.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"284.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"end\">−10</text><line x1=\"176.0\" y1=\"279.0\" x2=\"176.0\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"1\"/><text x=\"176.0\" y=\"301.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1000</text><line x1=\"288.0\" y1=\"279.0\" x2=\"288.0\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"1\"/><text x=\"288.0\" y=\"301.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2000</text><line x1=\"400.0\" y1=\"279.0\" x2=\"400.0\" y2=\"285.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"1\"/><text x=\"400.0\" y=\"301.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3000</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"321.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"end\">τ (s)</text><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"92.0\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"92.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" opacity=\"0.4\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"262.0\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"262.0\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" opacity=\"0.4\"/><polyline fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34d399\" stroke-width=\"2.8\" points=\"64.0,279.0 66.4,262.0 103.8,262.0 150.8,92.0 403.9,92.0\"/><circle cx=\"64.0\" cy=\"279.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#34d399\"/><circle cx=\"66.4\" cy=\"262.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#34d399\"/><circle cx=\"103.8\" cy=\"262.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#34d399\"/><circle cx=\"150.8\" cy=\"92.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#34d399\"/><circle cx=\"403.9\" cy=\"92.0\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"250\" y=\"62\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">4. Hoá hơi ở 100 °C</text><text x=\"250\" y=\"80\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">L = Pτ/m</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">3. Nước 0 → 100 °C</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"188\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">c = Pτ/(mΔt)</text><line x1=\"165\" y1=\"165\" x2=\"134\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.9\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"54\" fill=\"#fb923c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">2. Tan ở 0 °C</text><text x=\"74\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#fb923c\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">λ = Pτ/m</text><line x1=\"86\" y1=\"78\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"257\" stroke=\"#fb923c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.9\"/><text x=\"74\" y=\"321.0\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"start\">1. Đá −10 → 0 °C</text><line x1=\"70\" y1=\"308.0\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"283.0\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\" opacity=\"0.9\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"349.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">Đoạn ngang: nhiệt dùng để chuyển thể,</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"369.0\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"start\">nhiệt độ không đổi.</text></svg></figure>"
